cff-version: 1.2.0
message: "If you use this software, please cite it as below."
title: "EnviReader"
type: software
abstract: >-
  EnviReader reads, explores and compares ENVI-met simulation results (EDX/EDT, INX)
  directly in the browser: 2D maps and sections, a 3D model viewer with wind streamlines
  and sun position, time series, boundary conditions and a Web GIS view. All processing
  happens in the browser; no data is uploaded.
